            ["SVNAssist richiede il runtime .NET 10, che non e' installato.\n\nInstalla automaticamente: parte l'installazione (winget, oppure lo script ufficiale dotnet-install) in una finestra visibile.\n\nApri pagina download: scarica \".NET Runtime 10.x – Windows x64 installer\" (non l'SDK), installalo e riprova."] = "SVNAssist requires the .NET 10 runtime, which is not installed.\n\nInstall automatically: starts the installation (winget, or the official dotnet-install script) in a visible window.\n\nOpen download page: download \".NET Runtime 10.x – Windows x64 installer\" (not the SDK), install it and try again.",
